# Visible punctuation

User-facing text uses a hyphen (`-`). Do not use an em dash (`—`) or an en dash (`–`) in titles, labels, body copy, mail, admin placeholders, or stored catalog text.

Write `Buderus - DDS Services Group`, not `Buderus — DDS Services Group`.

Romanian quotation marks (`„ ”`) stay. The truncation mark in meta descriptions stays.

Do not add other generated-text habits in interface copy: markdown emphasis, decorative arrows, or emoji.
